WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.147
[sniffing]

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:25.025
[shudders, gasps] Rabbits!

00:00:26.193 --> 00:00:27.569
[retching]

00:00:29.655 --> 00:00:32.074
