00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:36.620
[coughing]

00:00:36.954 --> 00:00:37.955
Oh--
[breathes heavily, coughs]

00:00:37.955 --> 00:00:44.336
You see, the tiniest amount of
bad luck can shut down our
entire operation.

00:00:44.586 --> 00:01:01.436
